# 必考词 Unit18
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-必考词
# 描述: 必考词Unit18核心高频词汇

{{provide}}{/prəˈvaɪd/}}{v. 提供；供给}}{{The scholarship provides financial support for needy students.}}

{{provoke}}{/prəˈvəʊk/}}{v. 激怒；引起}}{{The speech provoked a heated debate among the audience.}}

{{purchase}}{/ˈpɜːrtʃəs/}}{v./n. 购买}}{{The company purchased a new office building downtown.}}

{{pursue}}{/pəˈsjuː/}}{v. 追求；从事}}{{He decided to pursue a career in medicine.}}

{{qualify}}{/ˈkwɒlɪfaɪ/}}{v. 使合格；取得资格}}{{She qualified as a doctor after years of training.}}

{{quote}}{/kwəʊt/}}{v. 引用；n. 引语}}{{The journalist quoted the president in the article.}}

{{racial}}{/ˈreɪʃl/}}{adj. 种族的}}{{Racial discrimination is prohibited by law.}}

{{radical}}{/ˈrædɪkl/}}{adj. 激进的；根本的}}{{The company underwent radical changes in its management.}}

{{random}}{/ˈrændəm/}}{adj. 随机的；任意的}}{{The participants were selected at random.}}

{{range}}{/reɪndʒ/}}{n. 范围；v. 变化}}{{The store offers a wide range of products.}}

{{rank}}{/ræŋk/}}{n. 等级；排名；v. 排列}}{{The university ranks among the top ten in the country.}}

{{rapid}}{/ˈræpɪd/}}{adj. 迅速的；快的}}{{The rapid growth of the city has led to traffic problems.}}

{{rare}}{/reər/}}{adj. 稀有的；罕见的}}{{The rare species of bird was spotted in the forest.}}

{{rate}}{/reɪt/}}{n. 比率；速度；v. 评价}}{{The unemployment rate has decreased this quarter.}}

{{ratio}}{/ˈreɪʃiəʊ/}}{n. 比；比率}}{{The ratio of teachers to students is one to twenty.}}

{{rational}}{/ˈræʃnəl/}}{adj. 理性的；合理的}}{{We need a rational approach to solving this problem.}}

{{react}}{/riˈækt/}}{v. 反应；起化学反应}}{{How did the audience react to the announcement?}}

{{reality}}{/riˈæləti/}}{n. 现实；实际}}{{We must face the reality of the situation.}}

{{realm}}{/relm/}}{n. 领域；王国}}{{This discovery opened up new realms of scientific research.}}

{{reasonable}}{/ˈriːznəbl/}}{adj. 合理的；公道的}}{{The prices at this restaurant are very reasonable.}}

{{rebel}}{/ˈrebl/}}{n. 叛乱者；v. 反抗}}{{The rebels fought against the oppressive regime.}}

{{recall}}{/rɪˈkɔːl/}}{v. 回忆；召回}}{{I cannot recall the exact date of the meeting.}}

{{recognition}}{/ˌrekəɡˈnɪʃn/}}{n. 认识；承认}}{{The artist gained international recognition for her work.}}

{{recommend}}{/ˌrekəˈmend/}}{v. 推荐；建议}}{{I highly recommend this book to anyone interested in history.}}

{{recover}}{/rɪˈkʌvər/}}{v. 恢复；收回}}{{The patient is expected to recover fully within a few weeks.}}

{{recruit}}{/rɪˈkruːt/}}{v. 招募；n. 新成员}}{{The company is recruiting new graduates for the training program.}}

{{reduce}}{/rɪˈdjuːs/}}{v. 减少；降低}}{{The government aims to reduce carbon emissions by 30%.}}

{{refer}}{/rɪˈfɜːr/}}{v. 提到；参考；转介}}{{Please refer to the manual for detailed instructions.}}

{{reflect}}{/rɪˈflekt/}}{v. 反映；反射；思考}}{{The report reflects the current state of the economy.}}

{{reform}}{/rɪˈfɔːrm/}}{v./n. 改革；改良}}{{The education reform introduced new teaching methods.}}

{{refuse}}{/rɪˈfjuːz/}}{v. 拒绝}}{{She refused to accept the unfair conditions.}}

{{regard}}{/rɪˈɡɑːrd/}}{v. 认为；n. 尊重；关于}}{{He is regarded as one of the greatest scientists of his time.}}

{{region}}{/ˈriːdʒən/}}{n. 地区；区域}}{{The region is known for its rich cultural heritage.}}

{{register}}{/ˈredʒɪstər/}}{v. 登记；注册}}{{You need to register for the course before the deadline.}}

{{regulate}}{/ˈreɡjuleɪt/}}{v. 管理；调节}}{{Laws are designed to regulate the behavior of citizens.}}

{{reject}}{/rɪˈdʒekt/}}{v. 拒绝；驳回}}{{The proposal was rejected by the committee.}}

{{relate}}{/rɪˈleɪt/}}{v. 联系；叙述}}{{The study relates diet to overall health outcomes.}}

{{release}}{/rɪˈliːs/}}{v./n. 释放；发布}}{{The company released a statement regarding the incident.}}

{{relevant}}{/ˈreləvənt/}}{adj. 相关的；切题的}}{{Please provide information relevant to the topic.}}

{{reliable}}{/rɪˈlaɪəbl/}}{adj. 可靠的；可信赖的}}{{She is a reliable member of the team.}}
